  "hero_headline": "AI代理自主化迎来落地潮，全球市场因高利率与地缘风险震荡 / AI Agents Enter Deployment Phase, Global Markets Shaken by Rates and Geopolitics",
  "daily_overview": "科技领域，AI代理技术实现突破，从「手机Agent」到科研辅助，自主执行能力成为核心竞争力；财经市场方面，受通胀预期与AI融资担忧影响，全球芯片股重挫，避险情绪升温导致美债走强；地缘政治上，伊朗局势紧张升级，乌克兰战事受制于通信限制，全球供应链与政策博弈持续发酵。整体来看，AI正从工具转向劳动代理，而经济环境则进入了高利率挤压下的“减量博弈”阶段。\n\nIn technology, AI agents are reaching new milestones from device-native agents to scientific research, with autonomous execution becoming the key competitive edge. Financially, global chip stocks are reeling under pressure from inflation fears and AI funding concerns, driving demand for safe-haven assets like U.S. Treasuries. Geopolitically, rising tensions in Iran and battlefield connectivity constraints in Ukraine underscore a period of heightened supply chain and policy friction. Overall, AI is transitioning from tools to autonomous agents, while the economy enters a contractionary phase under high-interest-rate pressure.",
